{"id":"defensa","lemma":"defensa","pos":"noun","rank":922,"glosses":["defense","retaining wall","bumper"],"ipa":"/deˈfensa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"defensas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-defensa.wav","examples":[{"text":"La mejor defensa es un buen ataque.","en":"Attack is the best form of defense.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352780","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"better"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"attack"}]},{"text":"Deberías aprender defensa personal.","en":"You should learn self-defense.","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to learn"},null,{"g":"personal"}]},{"text":"Supuestamente ella le mató en defensa propia.","en":"She allegedly killed him in self-defense.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608814","words":[{"g":"supposedly"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to kill, slay","l":"matar"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"own","l":"propio"}]},{"text":"Nuestro equipo de football tiene una buena defensa.","en":"Our football team has a good defense.","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us"},{"g":"team"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},null]},{"text":"Nuestras tropas consiguieron traspasar las defensas del enemigo.","en":"Our army broke through the enemy defenses.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691358","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"troop, crowd","l":"tropa"},{"g":"to achieve","l":"conseguir"},{"g":"to transfer"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"adverse"}]}]}